{title: Give Me Oil in My Lamp}
{artist: Anonymous}
{key: G}
{time: 4/4}
{tempo: 108}

Verse 1
[G]Give me oil in my lamp, keep me [C]burning,
[G]give me oil in my lamp, I [D]pray.
[G]Give me oil in my lamp, keep me [C]burning,
[G]keep me [D]burning till the break of [G]day.

Chorus
Sing ho[G]sanna, sing ho[C]sanna,
sing ho[G]sanna to the King of [D]kings!
Sing ho[G]sanna, sing ho[C]sanna,
sing ho[G]san[D]na to the [G]King.

Verse 2
[G]Give me joy in my heart, keep me [C]praising,
[G]give me joy in my heart, I [D]pray.
[G]Give me joy in my heart, keep me [C]praising,
[G]keep me [D]praising till the break of [G]day.
